  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> commute, we can apply binomial theorem to expand <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we have,<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />But,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∵</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mi>A</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>I</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math>"
  }
